{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your &quot;spine&quot; with the mouse, swing the stick, and strike the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A movement-based home run derby game awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against challenging opponents who throw bizarre, physics-defying breaking balls in 3D space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585340/extras/1.gif?t=1742612487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swing your arm (mouse) and aim for the ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585340/extras/2.gif?t=1742612487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read the trajectory of the relentless stream of baseballs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585340/extras/3.gif?t=1742612487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat powerful foes with the ultimate &quot;Secret Technique&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585340/extras/4.gif?t=1742612487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you defeat every opponent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carries the spirit of a legendary home run derby game once known in Japan.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully designed difficulty \u2014 challenging yet never impossible.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the sake of peace on your desk, we recommend a clean workspace and a wireless mouse.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the satisfying sensation of a perfectly timed hit.</p>